  "description": "In the town of Yadamgoeul, where tales of all manner of monsters, spirits, and human stories are woven, Seol-Ah lives. Following in her father's footsteps as a hunter, she becomes a fearless hunter who races through the mountains. Seol-Ah, hunting the nine-tailed fox that brutally killed her father to avenge his death, awakens after a fall in the home of the dazzlingly beautiful scholar Baek-Ho. She finds herself utterly helpless under Baek-Ho's secretive and gentle touch...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: The first story in Coconut's Jeonradonghwa Danpyeonseon (전라동화全裸童話 단편선) Collection.*",
